'''Pabu cove''' was a rocky cove located on the island of [[Pabu island|Pabu]]. The cove was below the seawall that delineated [[Lower Pabu|Lower]] and [[Upper Pabu]], but lay in a largely uninhabited part of the island, away from the populous. For that reason, was a good retreat for those looking to be alone or escape into their thoughts. The cove was mostly slippery rocks, with some sandy beach included. A cavern was located there as well.<ref name="Harbinger" />

